Subject: [PATCH] Add web UI favicon

Brighten up your bookmarks. Ship raspisump/static/favicon.svg, simple
sump-pit water-level icon.

Tests (tests/test_web_favicon.py): assert the asset exists and is valid
SVG (runs anywhere) that it is served at /static/favicon.svg as image/svg+xml
and linked from every rendered page.

All tests pass.
